    "name": "AWS SSM Parameter Store Credential Enumeration",
    "description": "Attacker enumerates SSM Parameter Store for stored credentials and configuration secrets. DescribeParameters reveals parameter names and metadata, then GetParameter and GetParameters retrieve actual values including SecureString parameters with withDecryption. SSM Parameter Store is commonly used to store database connection strings, API keys, and service passwords.",
